                                "sense_id": "90a5ab03-4835-3237-956d-3781d60314db",
                                "text": "China is still preeminent for its Goldfish, of which Pennant informs us that the most beautiful kinds, both for elegance of shape and richness of tinting, are taken in a small lake in the Province of Che-kyang."
                            }
                        ]
